Package: spagam
Title: GAM-Based Spatial Correction for Field Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alex", "Douglas", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "a.douglas@abdn.ac.uk")
Description: Fits mgcv-based GAM spatial correction models for unreplicated
    field trials. Supports single-bench designs (BLUEs and BLUPs) and joint
    multi-bench designs (BLUEs only). Outputs corrected genotype estimates,
    spatial trend surfaces, diagnostic plots, and model summaries. Includes
    simulation utilities for generating realistic trial data.
